        {
          "text": "nayo yonke imizi yasethafeni, nombuso wonke kaSihoni, inkosi yama-Amori, owayebusa eHeshiboni, owanqotshwa nguMose kanye nezikhulu zakwaMidiyani, o-Evi, noRekemi, noSuri, noHure, noReba, izikhulu zakwaMidiyani. USihoni, ohlala ezweni.",
